language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit AptDomain.
capability ValidatedAptDefinitions.
functionality ImportAptDefinition.
functionality EditAptDraft.
functionality StoreAptDraft.
functionality ExportAptDefinition.
functionality ActivateAptDefinition.

BuckingService contains AptDomain.
AptDomain provides ValidatedAptDefinitions.
AptDomain status proposed.
AptDomain cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/DetailedArchitectureDiscussion.md".
AptDomain owns ImportAptDefinition.
ImportAptDefinition realizes ValidatedAptDefinitions.
ImportAptDefinition specifies "Decode supported source with codec; preserve common and standard-specific fields, digest, source/version and companion semantics.".
AptDomain owns EditAptDraft.
EditAptDraft realizes ValidatedAptDefinitions.
EditAptDraft specifies "Validate target/cell identity, expected draft revision, authority and domain rules before publishing a new accepted revision.".
AptDomain owns StoreAptDraft.
StoreAptDraft realizes ValidatedAptDefinitions.
StoreAptDraft specifies "Validate complete draft; explicit create-new/update-existing identity; persistence and codec export are domain operations.".
AptDomain owns ExportAptDefinition.
ExportAptDefinition realizes ValidatedAptDefinitions.
ExportAptDefinition specifies "Use the matching codec to produce authoritative bytes/name/digest without renderer-side serialization.".
AptDomain owns ActivateAptDefinition.
ActivateAptDefinition realizes ValidatedAptDefinitions.
ActivateAptDefinition specifies "Separate import/load/save from explicit active-definition policy; existing import activate flag must be reconciled, never ignored or treated as implicit authority.".
